<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>输入访问密钥 — Team Cloud Drive</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    .key-entry-wrapper {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #e8ecf1 100%);
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .key-entry-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      padding: 40px 36px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .key-entry-icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0071e3, #5ac8fa);
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 28px;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .key-entry-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1d1d1f;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .key-entry-desc {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #86868b;
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .key-entry-input-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .key-entry-input {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-family: inherit;
      border: 2px solid #e5e5e7;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #f5f5f7;
      outline: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .key-entry-input:focus {
      border-color: #0071e3;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0,113,227,0.08);
    }
    .key-entry-submit {
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-family: inherit;
      background: #0071e3;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .key-entry-submit:hover {
      background: #0066cc;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    .key-entry-error {
      background: #fff2f0;
      border: 1px solid #ffccc7;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #cf1322;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: <%= typeof error !== 'undefined' && error ? 'block' : 'none' %>;
    }
    .key-entry-footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #aeaeb2;
    }
    .key-entry-footer a {
      color: #0071e3;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .key-entry-brand {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #86868b;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    /* Bounce animation for icon */
    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-4px); }
    }
    .key-entry-icon {
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="key-entry-wrapper">
    <div class="key-entry-card">
      <div class="key-entry-icon">🔑</div>
      <p class="key-entry-brand">Team Cloud Drive</p>
      <h2 class="key-entry-title">输入访问密钥</h2>
      <p class="key-entry-desc">
        此页面内容需要访问密钥才能查看。<br>
        请输入管理员提供的密钥以继续。
      </p>

      <div class="key-entry-error"><%= typeof error !== 'undefined' ? error : '' %></div>

      <form method="POST" action="/key-entry">
        <% if (typeof redirect !== 'undefined' && redirect) { %>
        <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="<%= redirect %>">
        <% } %>
        <div class="key-entry-input-group">
          <input
            type="text"
            name="key"
            class="key-entry-input"
            placeholder="输入您的访问密钥…"
            value="<%= typeof key !== 'undefined' ? key : '' %>"
            autofocus
            autocomplete="off"
          >
          <button type="submit" class="key-entry-submit">进入</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <p class="key-entry-footer">
        没有密钥？请联系文件管理员获取 &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <a href="/">返回首页</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
